      q.1.val*(ConcretePrimeRowBridge.idealGenerator q.2.val)^6 at hpq
    rw [ha] at hpq
    exact mul_right_cancel₀ (pow_ne_zero _ (ConcretePrimeRowBridge.idealGenerator_ne_zero
